WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.595
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.865 --> 01:45.465
It's beautiful! How did you find this restaurant?

3
01:47.065 --> 01:49.825
A colleague in Prague recommended it. I never got a chance to come before.

4
01:49.905 --> 01:52.385
But after getting the day off yesterday, I booked a table right away.

5
01:52.465 --> 01:55.105
So you have to thank me for this, right?

6
01:56.945 --> 01:58.465
Yes, it's all thanks to you.

7
02:03.865 --> 02:04.945
Taking photos again?

8
02:08.985 --> 02:09.905
I'm recording a video.

9
02:11.545 --> 02:12.585
Recording a video?

10
02:13.105 --> 02:15.065
You seem to really enjoy taking videos lately.

11
02:15.145 --> 02:16.305
What are you going to use it for?

12
02:17.625 --> 02:18.665
I don't know.

13
02:18.745 --> 02:20.865
Maybe they'll come in handy someday.

14
02:22.345 --> 02:24.825
Don't tell me you're tired of biology and want to switch careers?

15
02:26.665 --> 02:30.825
If I ever edit a movie and it's released, you'd better come see it.

16
02:32.785 --> 02:35.665
We haven't even started drinking and you're already talking nonsense.

17
02:46.545 --> 02:47.385
You ordered wine?

18
02:48.825 --> 02:50.625
Your colleague recommended this too?

19
02:50.705 --> 02:52.985
When you're in Prague, you have to try a glass.

20
02:53.065 --> 02:54.705
-Cheers. -Cheers.

21
02:59.945 --> 03:02.545
It's good. But I can barely taste the alcohol.

22
03:19.665 --> 03:20.585
Are you still recording?

23
03:22.865 --> 03:23.785
You seem really happy.

24
03:24.905 --> 03:25.985
Of course I am!

25
03:26.065 --> 03:28.825
I've finished presenting my project. You're almost done with yours too.

26
03:28.905 --> 03:31.225
We're here in Prague,

27
03:31.305 --> 03:35.345
with a beautiful view outside, and good wine on the table.

28
03:37.305 --> 03:38.345
Sip it slowly.

29
03:39.025 --> 03:39.985
It's fine.

30
03:40.065 --> 03:41.945
I can barely taste the alcohol. It's like juice.

31
03:43.625 --> 03:46.465
-The kick might sneak up on you later. -No way!

32
03:58.345 --> 03:59.185
It tastes good!

33
04:03.465 --> 04:04.585
Cheers!

34
04:05.545 --> 04:06.705
This isn't a wine bottle.

35
04:08.745 --> 04:10.065
This isn't a wine bottle?

36
04:11.865 --> 04:16.105
Then this is a princess's magic wand!

37
04:16.184 --> 04:20.825
Well, I wonder if I might have the honor of keeping this magic wand safe for you?

38
04:23.985 --> 04:25.505
Okay, I'll give it to you.

39
04:26.785 --> 04:27.625
But

40
04:27.705 --> 04:29.545
why are you taking it away?

41
04:31.265 --> 04:32.185
Because you're drunk.

42
04:33.345 --> 04:35.025
No, I'm not. Not at all.

43
04:37.025 --> 04:37.865
How are you not?

44
04:37.945 --> 04:39.905
The last time you got drunk, you acted just like this.

45
04:41.185 --> 04:44.345
But you're actually pretty cute when you drink too much. Like a kitten.

46
04:45.345 --> 04:47.865
A kitten? What does a kitten look like?

47
04:50.865 --> 04:52.745
Let me record it and show you. Then you'll see.

48
04:57.145 --> 04:58.105
This is so hard.

49
05:00.305 --> 05:02.145
What question could possibly stump our Ms. Zheng?

50
05:02.785 --> 05:03.625
I…

51
05:03.705 --> 05:07.625
Before I came here, I had so many things planned to tell you.

52
05:07.705 --> 05:09.065
Fangli even gave me advice

53
05:09.145 --> 05:10.665
on how to say sweet things

54
05:10.745 --> 05:12.185
and act cute.

55
05:13.385 --> 05:16.985
But ever since I got here, I haven't said a single word of it.

56
05:21.425 --> 05:25.305
Aren't you pretty good at acting cute? Remember Qingshan Island?

57
05:27.025 --> 05:28.345
Qingshan Island?

58
05:30.025 --> 05:31.065
Chen Yanzhou.

59
05:31.145 --> 05:34.785
I know you were just playing along back then.

60
05:37.985 --> 05:40.225
Forget it. If I don't know it, so be it.

61
05:40.825 --> 05:42.585
Exactly. If you don't know it, so be it.

62
05:42.665 --> 05:44.465
You don't have to be good at everything.

63
05:44.545 --> 05:46.385
That's right. As long as you can do it.

64
05:50.705 --> 05:52.105
I want to hear you act cute.

65
05:52.185 --> 05:54.305
You… You're the best at it.

66
05:54.385 --> 05:56.025
Can you do it for me to hear, please?

67
06:01.585 --> 06:02.545
Okay.

68
06:02.625 --> 06:03.825
What kind do you want to hear?

69
06:05.265 --> 06:07.425
Let's start with something simple.

70
06:07.505 --> 06:09.585
Like "kitty" or "puppy."

71
06:09.665 --> 06:12.145
Just cute words like that.

72
06:14.865 --> 06:15.705
Okay.

73
06:19.505 --> 06:20.665
I want

74
06:20.745 --> 06:21.785
a hug.

75
06:26.465 --> 06:27.545
I want

76
06:28.105 --> 06:29.025
a kiss.

77
06:30.665 --> 06:31.865
How was that?

78
06:31.945 --> 06:32.945
Did I pass?

79
06:35.785 --> 06:36.985
I want a hug!

80
06:37.065 --> 06:38.745
I want

81
06:38.825 --> 06:39.665
a kiss.

82
06:44.745 --> 06:46.945
Our Ms. Zheng is still a quick learner.

83
07:01.425 --> 07:02.745
Chen Yanzhou.

84
07:02.825 --> 07:06.705
Besides hugs and kisses, I want to sway too.

85
07:07.985 --> 07:09.145
Sway?

86
07:09.825 --> 07:10.865
It's like

87
07:11.425 --> 07:12.265
this, and this.

88
07:12.345 --> 07:13.585
And then…

89
07:14.305 --> 07:16.585
And then like this,

90
07:16.665 --> 07:17.865
and this.

91
07:18.465 --> 07:19.665
You want to dance?

92
07:22.025 --> 07:23.425
How do you want to dance?

93
07:25.545 --> 07:26.985
You haven't even asked me.

94
07:32.025 --> 07:33.425
So half-hearted.

95
07:41.145 --> 07:41.985
My princess,

96
07:42.065 --> 07:44.065
may I have this dance with you?

97
08:14.865 --> 08:16.185
Chen Yanzhou.

98
08:16.265 --> 08:18.785
Did I just step on your foot?

99
08:20.145 --> 08:21.225
That's the seventh time.

100
08:21.905 --> 08:23.545
Then why didn't you dodge?

101
08:24.985 --> 08:26.185
I didn't want to.

102
08:26.265 --> 08:29.025
Having the princess step on my feet is an honor.

103
08:57.305 --> 08:58.225
How is it?

104
08:58.945 --> 09:00.785
Feeling a little more sober after swaying around?

105
09:01.345 --> 09:03.225
I was completely sober to begin with!

106
09:09.545 --> 09:10.825
Chen Yanzhou.

107
09:11.425 --> 09:12.585
You're so handsome.

108
09:15.025 --> 09:17.465
My boyfriend is really handsome.

109
09:19.145 --> 09:20.705
Looks like you're still not fully sober.

110
09:21.745 --> 09:23.625
You only say things like this when you're drunk.

111
09:24.185 --> 09:26.825
Then from now on, I'll tell you every day.

112
09:29.345 --> 09:31.105
Say it more. I love hearing it.

113
09:36.745 --> 09:38.025
It's so beautiful here.

114
09:38.905 --> 09:40.545
But Qingyi is even more beautiful.

115
09:43.345 --> 09:44.705
Chen Yanzhou.

116
09:45.265 --> 09:47.185
I'm feeling a little homesick.

117
09:56.905 --> 09:58.865
Then let's go back and visit.

118
10:04.785 --> 10:06.105
HI, HAVE A NICE TRIP! BERLIN - QINGYI

119
10:06.185 --> 10:07.305
Chen Yanzhou.

120
10:07.385 --> 10:08.865
You…

121
10:08.945 --> 10:10.185
Are you a magician?

122
10:11.425 --> 10:12.425
No, I'm not.

123
10:13.425 --> 10:16.625
Maybe it's because I have the princess's magic wand.

124
10:18.465 --> 10:20.145
You're treating me like a three-year-old.

125
10:22.585 --> 10:26.505
A while ago, I noticed you kept looking at your chat with Xiaomian.

126
10:26.585 --> 10:28.985
I was feeling homesick too, so I bought two tickets.

127
10:55.025 --> 10:56.985
Here, let's have a drink.

128
10:57.065 --> 10:57.985
Cheers.

129
11:09.145 --> 11:11.505
In the old days, when you two walked together,

130
11:11.585 --> 11:13.305
there was still room for me between you.

131
11:13.385 --> 11:15.985
But now, you two barely leave room for a sheet of paper!

132
11:17.505 --> 11:20.425
Really? I seem to remember you were always squeezing between us.

133
11:20.505 --> 11:22.625
Am I really the kind of person

134
11:22.705 --> 11:24.665
who's that tactless and oblivious?

135
11:24.745 --> 11:28.825
Didn't someone try to play matchmaker for the wrong people before?

136
11:28.905 --> 11:30.665
What do you mean by playing matchmaker?

137
11:30.745 --> 11:34.465
Let's not bring up the past. I'll drink to make up for it.

138
11:36.585 --> 11:37.665
I'll tell you about it later.

139
11:39.265 --> 11:41.945
Hey, keep public decorum in mind. There is still a person right here.

140
11:45.705 --> 11:46.585
Do you two know

141
11:47.265 --> 11:50.265
that when I saw Zheng Yu's post on Moments,

142
11:50.345 --> 11:52.585
I was right in the middle of doing a Western blot?

143
11:52.665 --> 11:54.545
I know. You mentioned that ages ago.

144
11:54.625 --> 11:57.585
What I didn't mention was that I was cutting the membrane at the time.

145
11:58.265 --> 12:01.505
When I saw the post, my hand slipped and I cut off the internal control.

146
12:01.585 --> 12:03.625
The entire batch of samples was ruined!

147
12:04.465 --> 12:06.185
That's a problem with your lab skills then.

148
12:06.265 --> 12:07.985
Exactly, and you're blaming us for that?

149
12:09.785 --> 12:11.865
Fine. You two are on the same team now.

150
12:11.945 --> 12:13.505
I'm not arguing with you.

151
12:15.865 --> 12:17.585
How long are you staying this time?

152
12:17.665 --> 12:19.345
Not long. We're leaving in two days.

153
12:20.585 --> 12:21.425
Leaving so soon?

154
12:22.025 --> 12:23.505
Try studying in Germany sometime.

155
12:23.585 --> 12:25.025
Me? I'd never put myself through that.

156
12:27.465 --> 12:29.185
Then where are you staying while you're here?

157
12:29.265 --> 12:32.025
I know Chen Yanzhou's place is near Qing Yi University,

158
12:32.105 --> 12:33.545
but you're not from Qingyi.

159
12:34.345 --> 12:36.265
Or are you going back to your hometown for a few days?

160
12:38.985 --> 12:39.945
Bi Dezheng.

161
12:40.025 --> 12:42.425
Guess where we set off from to come have dinner here?

162
12:42.505 --> 12:43.905
How would I know?

163
12:43.985 --> 12:46.425
If we had that kind of telepathy, Zheng Yu would be jealous.

164
12:48.345 --> 12:49.225
My family's house.

165
12:51.265 --> 12:52.625
You already met his parents?

166
12:56.385 --> 12:57.345
They've met before.

167
13:00.905 --> 13:02.225
"They've met before."

168
13:04.385 --> 13:05.665
Okay, it's my bad.

169
13:05.745 --> 13:07.265
I'll drink to make up for it, okay?

170
13:15.305 --> 13:16.265
Zheng Yu.

171
13:16.345 --> 13:17.185
Listen.

172
13:17.825 --> 13:19.545
If Chen Yanzhou ever picks on you,

173
13:20.145 --> 13:21.265
tell me.

174
13:21.345 --> 13:23.065
I may not be able to beat him,

175
13:23.145 --> 13:24.225
but I can…

176
13:25.105 --> 13:25.945
You can what?

177
13:28.065 --> 13:29.185
I can cry to him.

178
13:33.545 --> 13:34.985
Chen Yanzhou, you too.

179
13:35.065 --> 13:36.225
If Zheng Yu ever picks on you…

180
13:38.225 --> 13:39.185
What will you do?

181
13:40.385 --> 13:42.145
I… I'd advise you to bear it.

182
13:44.945 --> 13:47.305
Bi Dezheng, you're really good at applying rules flexibly.

183
13:47.385 --> 13:48.425
Of course.

184
13:50.065 --> 13:52.465
Being able to see you two so happy…

185
13:55.305 --> 13:56.825
makes me happy too.

186
14:23.705 --> 14:27.425
Good thing I still remembered where Bi Dezheng's graduate dorm was.

187
14:27.505 --> 14:29.705
Otherwise, we'd have had to take him home.

188
14:29.785 --> 14:31.145
I wouldn't have minded.

189
14:31.945 --> 14:32.945
I would have.

190
14:39.185 --> 14:40.065
What's so funny?

191
14:41.105 --> 14:42.185
Come to think of it,

192
14:42.265 --> 14:44.865
I've walked down this road countless times before.

193
14:44.945 --> 14:46.265
But I never imagined

194
14:46.345 --> 14:48.905
that walking down it while holding your hand would feel so different.

195
14:50.145 --> 14:51.345
Did you ever imagine it?

196
14:52.225 --> 14:53.505
Imagine what?

197
14:54.505 --> 14:57.865
Back at that first meeting, did you ever imagine that someday,

198
14:57.945 --> 15:01.905
you would share so many experiences and have such a journey together?

199
15:02.905 --> 15:05.345
Oh? That first meeting with who?

200
15:06.665 --> 15:08.065
Who do you think?

201
15:14.745 --> 15:17.025
To be honest, no.

202
15:17.105 --> 15:19.585
After all, back then, a certain someone suddenly showed up

203
15:19.665 --> 15:21.945
and took away the scholarship I needed to pay off my debt.

204
15:22.025 --> 15:24.705
Why would I want to have anything to do with that person?

205
15:26.225 --> 15:27.665
And what about later on?

206
15:30.265 --> 15:31.425
Later…

207
15:32.185 --> 15:34.505
Later, you told me that you wanted to win together with me,

208
15:34.585 --> 15:36.385
and that we were friends.

209
15:36.985 --> 15:40.385
Gradually, I realized you weren't quite what I had imagined.

210
15:42.785 --> 15:44.025
How was I different?

211
15:44.545 --> 15:46.745
At first, I found it strange.

212
15:47.625 --> 15:51.425
You were cold and distant at school, but when I went to your house,

213
15:51.505 --> 15:53.705
I saw how cheerful you were around your family.

214
15:53.785 --> 15:58.185
It took a long time for me to understand that behind that smile,

215
15:58.265 --> 15:59.385
there were so many stories.

216
16:01.425 --> 16:03.145
After going through so much together,

217
16:03.225 --> 16:06.705
I feel like I can truly be myself around you.

218
16:07.745 --> 16:09.425
And that made me realize

219
16:09.505 --> 16:11.985
that I wanted to share a story with someone like you.

220
16:15.305 --> 16:16.385
What about you?

221
16:16.465 --> 16:18.105
When we first met,

222
16:18.185 --> 16:20.465
did you already guess we'd go through so much together?

223
16:23.825 --> 16:24.905
I didn't know.

224
16:25.865 --> 16:27.105
But…

225
16:28.345 --> 16:29.185
I had a hunch.

226
16:29.905 --> 16:32.185
Because back then, I was just so curious about you.

227
16:32.865 --> 16:35.785
How could someone ask me to hit them with a ball

228
16:35.865 --> 16:38.465
just to cover up the fact that they were subbing for a class?

229
16:38.545 --> 16:40.665
And as if running the 1500 wasn't enough,

230
16:40.745 --> 16:42.105
you went and ran the 3,000 m too!

231
16:42.785 --> 16:45.305
Speaking of the scholarship, I also wondered

232
16:45.385 --> 16:47.025
why someone who needed that money so badly

233
16:47.105 --> 16:49.185
would still clear my name when I was accused of cheating.

234
16:51.105 --> 16:53.825
Isn't curiosity supposed to be the prelude to falling in love?

235
16:55.625 --> 16:59.105
I used to think this city was just a place to exist in.

236
16:59.185 --> 17:02.345
Every day, I'd go to class, then come home, eat, and sleep.

237
17:02.425 --> 17:03.865
It was always the same.

238
17:05.025 --> 17:08.065
But eventually, I started seeing it as a city full of possibilities.

239
17:09.224 --> 17:11.505
Because whenever I walked down the street,

240
17:11.585 --> 17:13.345
I might run into you at any moment.

241
17:15.785 --> 17:17.865
I never knew you had so many thoughts

242
17:17.944 --> 17:19.865
running through your head back then.

243
17:21.025 --> 17:22.065
Of course.

244
17:32.105 --> 17:34.585
It's our dorm group chat.

245
17:36.425 --> 17:38.425
You girls seem to chat pretty often.

246
17:39.545 --> 17:42.225
Especially since I just got back. We plan to meet up.

247
17:49.545 --> 17:51.145
Why aren't you saying anything?

248
17:52.985 --> 17:54.105
I was wondering

249
17:54.865 --> 17:58.265
if you ever talk to other people about us the way you just did then.

250
17:59.385 --> 18:00.825
Not really.

251
18:00.905 --> 18:02.825
But sometimes, you do come up in conversation.

252
18:02.905 --> 18:05.345
I tell them…

253
18:05.425 --> 18:06.265
You tell them what?

254
18:09.225 --> 18:11.985
What else would you discuss with friends when talking about boyfriends?

255
18:12.905 --> 18:14.025
Of course

256
18:14.105 --> 18:15.225
I tell them about your flaws.

257
18:17.745 --> 18:19.945
Then tell me, what flaws do I have?

258
18:23.665 --> 18:24.585
You…

259
18:24.665 --> 18:25.785
get jealous easily.

260
18:26.865 --> 18:28.545
And…

261
18:32.945 --> 18:34.065
Is it really that hard?

262
18:35.905 --> 18:37.225
How about I list them myself then?

263
18:38.025 --> 18:39.025
Jealous.

264
18:40.345 --> 18:41.665
Petty.

265
18:42.825 --> 18:43.905
Childish.

266
18:45.305 --> 18:46.345
Clingy.

267
18:49.585 --> 18:51.745
Chen Yanzhou, what are you doing?

268
18:53.745 --> 18:55.905
Offering my formal apologies for all my flaws.

269
18:56.905 --> 18:57.905
All you do is sweet-talk me.

270
18:59.145 --> 19:01.345
Fine. Let's add that to the list.

271
19:07.705 --> 19:09.225
Chen Yanzhou!

272
19:09.305 --> 19:11.065
Are you planning to spend the whole night

273
19:11.145 --> 19:12.225
listing all your flaws?

274
19:13.025 --> 19:15.665
I wouldn't mind. We've got all the time in the world.

275
19:17.265 --> 19:19.305
You're just looking for an excuse to kiss me.

276
19:22.385 --> 19:23.625
You caught me!

277
19:25.345 --> 19:28.185
Chen Yanzhou, you're getting more shameless by the day.

278
19:30.265 --> 19:31.865
Well, count that as another flaw then.

279
19:41.425 --> 19:43.305
That's enough. Let's go home.

280
19:54.825 --> 19:57.225
By the way, when are you meeting your roommates?

281
19:58.385 --> 19:59.385
Tomorrow.

282
20:00.145 --> 20:02.025
Okay, I'll pick you up afterward.

283
20:12.025 --> 20:14.105
So you can speak German now?

284
20:15.225 --> 20:16.705
I can handle basic conversations.

285
20:16.785 --> 20:19.785
I've also learned some technical terms, so I can follow lectures more easily.

286
20:20.385 --> 20:22.185
That's amazing, Zheng Yu!

287
20:22.985 --> 20:25.505
"The sun is super intense today and I'm practically melting."

288
20:25.585 --> 20:28.025
-How do you say that in German? -Come on!

289
20:28.105 --> 20:31.345
I just got back home and you're already making me keep studying German?

290
20:31.425 --> 20:32.825
Okay, fine.

291
20:32.905 --> 20:35.465
I'll ask something easier than German then.

292
20:36.185 --> 20:37.465
A relationship question!

293
20:37.545 --> 20:40.345
How far have things gotten between you and Chen Yanzhou?

294
20:42.025 --> 20:44.185
I think I'll answer your previous question instead.

295
20:44.265 --> 20:45.905
Which German phrase did you want to know?

296
20:45.985 --> 20:46.865
Okay, okay.

297
20:46.945 --> 20:48.705
You don't have to answer. We get the picture.

298
20:50.145 --> 20:52.185
You all already know that German phrase?

299
20:52.265 --> 20:54.225
Well, let me hear you say it then.

300
20:54.305 --> 20:56.505
I'll see which of you has the better pronunciation.

301
20:57.025 --> 20:58.265
Now you've learned to play dumb!

302
20:58.345 --> 21:00.785
What were we talking about over dinner earlier?

303
21:00.865 --> 21:03.745
Was it Zhuang Ning's showdown with her boss

304
21:03.825 --> 21:06.345
or Linlin's new crush?

305
21:07.105 --> 21:09.385
I think we were talking about you meeting Song Mo's parents!

306
21:10.145 --> 21:13.385
Look at her! On top of playing dumb, she's learned how to shift the spotlight!

307
21:13.465 --> 21:14.985
Fine, I won't say anything then.

308
21:18.065 --> 21:19.585
Is Chen Yanzhou coming to pick you up?

309
21:20.665 --> 21:22.705
We need to pick up his cousin and my brother in a bit.

310
21:22.785 --> 21:24.065
They went out together.

311
21:24.145 --> 21:26.745
Well, look at you! You've got everything all planned out.

312
21:26.825 --> 21:29.825
-You're already taking the kids along! -Xu Fangli! You…

313
21:31.665 --> 21:34.665
Seriously though, Zheng Yu, you really have changed a lot.

314
21:34.745 --> 21:35.745
Really?

315
21:35.825 --> 21:36.905
You smile so much more now!

316
21:36.985 --> 21:40.345
Do you realize how low your threshold for laughing is these days?

317
21:40.425 --> 21:41.745
Just like right now!

318
21:41.825 --> 21:43.865
-I'll take a photo so she can see! -Snap a photo of her!

319
21:46.025 --> 21:47.305
-Look at this. -Let me see.

320
21:49.945 --> 21:50.945
Right?

321
21:52.225 --> 21:53.465
We're at the entrance.

322
21:54.985 --> 21:56.185
Here!

323
22:09.305 --> 22:12.105
Whose boyfriend is this?

324
22:13.545 --> 22:14.625
Hers.

325
22:17.385 --> 22:19.585
Come on, we were not actually asking.

326
22:20.545 --> 22:23.025
You're here to pick her up so early. We've barely finished eating.

327
22:24.145 --> 22:25.545
My bad. It's my mistake.

328
22:27.465 --> 22:30.505
Since you and Zheng Yu brought us gifts, we'll let you off the hook.

329
22:30.585 --> 22:32.505
Thanks for the gifts!

330
22:33.025 --> 22:35.905
As for us, we wouldn't mind if you came back more often.

331
22:35.985 --> 22:38.585
Got it. Well, we have plans, so we should keep moving.

332
22:38.665 --> 22:41.865
-Bye. -Bye.

333
22:41.945 --> 22:43.665
Let's keep in touch on WeChat!

334
22:45.105 --> 22:46.825
What a gentleman!

335
22:49.385 --> 22:51.825
-Bye! -Bye!

336
22:51.905 --> 22:53.265
Don't miss me too much!

337
22:53.345 --> 22:55.225
-We'll miss you! -We'll miss you!

338
22:55.825 --> 22:58.065
-Bye! -Take care!

339
23:02.785 --> 23:04.425
Tell me.

340
23:04.505 --> 23:07.105
Can love really change a person this much?

341
23:08.385 --> 23:09.585
What if it's not changing her,

342
23:09.665 --> 23:12.145
but rather restoring her to the person she originally was?

343
23:13.065 --> 23:15.745
Xiaozhuang Ning, that was surprisingly deep!

344
23:20.345 --> 23:23.185
Song Mo is almost here. I'd better get going too.

345
23:23.265 --> 23:24.945
Let's catch up another time, bye!

346
23:25.025 --> 23:27.545
You were just lecturing Zheng Yu, and now you're the first to run off!

347
23:27.625 --> 23:28.625
Just go already!

348
23:28.705 --> 23:31.145
-Bye. -Bye.

349
23:31.225 --> 23:32.625
Aren't you used to it by now?

350
23:33.705 --> 23:34.545
Let's go.

351
23:35.145 --> 23:37.345
When will love finally come my way?

352
23:38.505 --> 23:40.985
I heard Germany is famous for its beer.

353
23:41.065 --> 23:42.465
Has your drinking improved?

354
23:43.185 --> 23:44.585
I don't drink much.

355
23:45.945 --> 23:48.265
That's true. What's so great about beer anyway?

356
23:50.505 --> 23:52.385
Are there lots of handsome guys in Germany?

357
23:53.705 --> 23:56.145
Tell me secretly. I promise I won't tell Yanzhou.

358
23:56.225 --> 23:57.145
Well…

359
23:57.225 --> 23:59.745
Gao Xing. I can hear you.

360
23:59.825 --> 24:02.265
Cover your ears. Then you won't hear!

361
24:03.345 --> 24:05.225
Are there lots of them?

362
24:05.305 --> 24:07.625
-Is it-- -Didn't your phone just ring?

363
24:07.705 --> 24:08.945
Was that your mom calling?

364
24:09.025 --> 24:11.305
What if it's something big, like college preferences?

365
24:11.385 --> 24:14.625
You must be hearing things! My phone's on silent.

366
24:14.705 --> 24:16.825
Besides, I've already submitted my applications.

367
24:17.865 --> 24:19.905
Really? What did you put as your first choice?

368
24:22.945 --> 24:24.145
It's a secret.

369
24:28.025 --> 24:29.585
Xiaomian, how's university life?

370
24:30.705 --> 24:31.545
It's pretty good.

371
24:32.665 --> 24:34.825
The computer science program at Ji An University is great.

372
24:34.905 --> 24:38.905
I heard you wrote some kind of program and even sold it recently.

373
24:40.065 --> 24:42.585
It was a pretty simple program. I didn't make much from it.

374
24:42.665 --> 24:45.185
That's still impressive. Gao Xing keeps telling me about it.

375
24:46.665 --> 24:48.145
Gao Xing did pretty well on her exams.

376
24:48.225 --> 24:49.905
You deserve credit for tutoring her.

377
24:50.945 --> 24:53.385
She must've been a handful. You worked hard.

378
24:54.105 --> 24:56.185
Yanzhou. I can hear you.

379
24:57.465 --> 24:59.145
Cover your ears. Then you won't hear.

380
25:02.385 --> 25:04.785
How much longer until we reach the beach?

381
25:04.865 --> 25:06.305
I can't take this driver anymore.

382
25:07.065 --> 25:08.345
Watch what you say.

383
25:08.425 --> 25:10.465
Your cousin might dump you on the side of the road.

384
25:12.985 --> 25:15.625
Now he can't.

385
25:21.785 --> 25:24.785
Yanzhou, you're so unoriginal.

386
25:25.545 --> 25:28.505
Next time, can you take us somewhere new? We've already been here.

387
25:29.545 --> 25:30.785
I think it's nice here.

388
25:31.425 --> 25:33.305
Actually, now I look again,

389
25:33.385 --> 25:35.905
different seasons really do have different vibes.

390
25:35.985 --> 25:37.825
I take back what I just said.

391
25:38.865 --> 25:40.265
You change your mind so quickly.

392
25:42.785 --> 25:45.105
Gao Xing, what's that thing hanging on your bag?

393
25:45.705 --> 25:48.865
A good luck charm. It's a popular way to wish good fortune online.

394
25:48.945 --> 25:50.025
It's really trendy.

395
25:50.745 --> 25:52.345
Xiaomian, you know quite a lot.

396
25:54.025 --> 25:55.985
I just happened to hear about it from someone.

397
25:56.945 --> 25:58.185
Did you make it yourself?

398
25:58.985 --> 26:00.225
Of course not.

399
26:00.825 --> 26:02.905
It won't work if you make it yourself.

400
26:02.985 --> 26:06.225
-It only works if someone gives it to you. -Someone?

401
26:06.305 --> 26:07.425
Who is this "someone"?

402
26:09.345 --> 26:11.785
Isn't that the spot where we took photos last time?

403
26:11.865 --> 26:13.265
Let's take another one there.

404
26:14.025 --> 26:15.705
What do you think,

405
26:15.785 --> 26:17.265
cousin-in-law?

406
26:17.345 --> 26:18.745
In-law…

407
26:18.825 --> 26:22.025
When you guys came to the beach last time, you didn't bring me along.

408
26:22.105 --> 26:23.545
I want to take photos this time too.

409
26:23.625 --> 26:24.985
Is it okay, brother-in-law?

410
26:25.825 --> 26:26.985
In-law…

411
26:30.385 --> 26:31.985
Yes, of course we'll take photos!

412
26:32.065 --> 26:34.065
Gao Xing, where's the camera? Hurry and take it out.

413
26:34.145 --> 26:35.665
-Come on, let's take yours first. -Okay!

414
26:35.745 --> 26:36.945
I'll go with him.

415
26:38.585 --> 26:40.625
Yanzhou, I'll take photos of you two in a bit!

416
26:42.985 --> 26:44.705
Fine then. Strike a pose!

417
26:46.705 --> 26:48.705
You're so far apart. How is that a couple photo?

418
26:49.785 --> 26:50.865
Move closer.

419
26:52.665 --> 26:53.985
A little closer.

420
26:59.585 --> 27:01.825
Three, two, one.

421
27:02.865 --> 27:04.345
All right.

422
27:04.425 --> 27:06.785
All right, let me take photos of you two!

423
27:17.785 --> 27:20.305
Ms. Zheng, you've changed.

424
27:20.985 --> 27:23.825
You weren't like this last time. You were practically out of the frame!

425
27:26.185 --> 27:29.105
That's because back then, I wasn't that close to your cousin.

426
27:29.785 --> 27:32.185
Watch your wording. We were only not close from your perspective.

427
27:33.025 --> 27:34.585
Not true.

428
27:34.665 --> 27:37.105
-Do you want me to explain in detail? -Go ahead then.

429
27:37.185 --> 27:38.905
-So you want me to spell it out? -Do it.

430
27:38.985 --> 27:40.785
Okay, stop bickering!

431
27:40.865 --> 27:43.545
Let's take a photo first. Are you ready?

432
27:44.905 --> 27:45.785
Three,

433
27:46.625 --> 27:47.625
two,

434
27:48.305 --> 27:49.305
one.

435
28:04.785 --> 28:06.945
Weren't you two just bickering a second ago?

436
28:07.025 --> 28:09.585
How did that turn into…?

437
28:11.505 --> 28:13.745
It's called romance. You wouldn't understand.

438
28:14.345 --> 28:16.745
Romance my foot! That's not suitable for kids!

439
28:17.745 --> 28:18.665
Let me see the photo.

440
28:18.745 --> 28:20.425
-No! -Just one look!

441
28:20.505 --> 28:22.025
-No way! -Gao Xing!

442
28:22.105 --> 28:23.945
-Let me look at the photo! -No way!

443
28:24.025 --> 28:25.425
-Let me see it! -No way!

444
28:26.825 --> 28:28.425
Hey, stop running! Name your price.

445
28:29.705 --> 28:30.545
Twenty thousand.

446
28:31.505 --> 28:32.545
Deal.

447
28:33.705 --> 28:35.785
I've changed my mind. Fifty thousand.

448
28:35.865 --> 28:36.865
Transfer it now.

449
28:38.385 --> 28:39.225
Deal.

450
28:39.985 --> 28:41.865
That's too much. We can just retake it.

451
28:41.945 --> 28:43.065
I'll sell it to you.

452
28:43.145 --> 28:44.065
At a discount even!

453
28:45.425 --> 28:46.745
Ms. Zheng!

454
28:46.825 --> 28:48.905
You're messing up the market and playing dirty.

455
28:52.265 --> 28:54.225
You two, slow down. Don't fall.

456
28:54.825 --> 28:56.505
Jiang Mian, whose side are you on?

457
28:57.985 --> 28:59.305
I…

458
29:00.105 --> 29:00.985
I'm not taking sides.

459
29:01.065 --> 29:02.465
Then we're no longer friends!

460
29:03.145 --> 29:05.225
Zheng Yu, slow down! Gao Xing, stop messing around!

461
29:25.185 --> 29:27.385
Are you guys heading back to Berlin already?

462
29:27.465 --> 29:29.025
Why? Are you going to miss us?

463
29:29.545 --> 29:30.825
Not at all!

464
29:31.785 --> 29:33.665
Okay, maybe a little.

465
29:34.385 --> 29:37.425
Whenever you guys have free time, come visit us in Germany.

466
29:37.505 --> 29:39.985
-I'm free tomorrow! -Gao Xing!

467
29:40.065 --> 29:42.265
-You can't go tomorrow. -Why not?

468
29:42.345 --> 29:43.745
You don't even have a visa yet.

469
29:45.585 --> 29:47.185
You're such a buzzkill!

470
29:47.905 --> 29:49.345
Xiaomian's just looking out for you.

471
29:49.425 --> 29:52.345
Yanzhou, you always side with outsiders!

472
29:54.065 --> 29:56.145
It's not like he's ever sided with you.

473
29:57.505 --> 29:59.625
Try saying that one more time!

474
30:01.025 --> 30:02.745
Gao Xing, don't get physical!

475
30:06.265 --> 30:07.825
Can I get physical then?

476
30:27.785 --> 30:31.705
ONE YEAR LATER

477
30:32.945 --> 30:33.825
Hello, good morning!

478
30:33.905 --> 30:35.785
It is currently 7:15 a.m.

479
30:35.865 --> 30:38.665
Today is the day of Ms. Zheng's sharing session.

480
30:38.745 --> 30:41.185
Let's see what color outfit Ms. Zheng chooses to wear today!

481
30:45.585 --> 30:46.865
She is carefully

482
30:46.945 --> 30:49.065
inspecting her wardrobe to see what colors she has.

483
30:49.665 --> 30:51.345
Ms. Zheng has chosen

484
30:51.425 --> 30:53.345
a beige-colored outfit.

485
30:54.905 --> 30:56.345
It's creamy yellow.

486
30:57.745 --> 30:59.145
Creamy yellow.

487
31:01.745 --> 31:02.905
Is there a difference?

488
31:02.985 --> 31:04.985
Ms. Zheng has picked up a belt,

489
31:05.065 --> 31:07.625
which is great for breaking up the monotony

490
31:07.705 --> 31:10.265
and adding a nice finishing touch.

491
31:11.185 --> 31:12.865
Now she's wrapped it around her neck.

492
31:12.945 --> 31:16.065
That is, presumably, probably, a silk scarf.

493
31:16.145 --> 31:18.745
Okay, Ms. Zheng has taken it off again.

494
31:18.825 --> 31:20.545
Let's see what she'll do next--

495
31:20.625 --> 31:22.105
Ms. Zheng is resorting to violence!

496
31:22.185 --> 31:24.185
I messed up the commentary, but does it warrant this?

497
31:24.265 --> 31:25.345
I'm going to get changed!

498
31:28.585 --> 31:31.985
Well then, let's all look forward to Ms. Zheng's final outfit choice today!

499
31:32.065 --> 31:33.145
Bye!

500
31:34.145 --> 31:37.705
Ms. Zheng is now sitting across from me, getting ready to eat.

501
31:37.785 --> 31:41.585
Let's see what Ms. Zheng is having for breakfast before her sharing session!

502
31:43.545 --> 31:44.865
This is way too lavish!

503
31:44.945 --> 31:46.505
Who prepared all this?

504
31:46.585 --> 31:48.505
Turns out Chef Xiaozhou made it!

505
31:48.585 --> 31:50.505
Why are you giving yourself extra screen time?

506
31:51.185 --> 31:52.625
Am I?

507
31:54.825 --> 31:55.865
Hi!

508
31:57.545 --> 31:58.425
Hurry up and eat.

509
31:58.505 --> 32:00.665
Don't you still have to escort me to the venue later?

510
32:04.705 --> 32:05.545
As you wish.

511
32:05.625 --> 32:08.105
Ms. Zheng's safety is in the hands of Bodyguard Xiaozhou.

512
32:10.105 --> 32:12.265
It is currently 8:20 a.m.

513
32:13.065 --> 32:14.625
Ms. Zheng is now taking the subway

514
32:14.705 --> 32:16.145
to the sharing session.

515
32:17.025 --> 32:19.705
She likely needs some time to do mental preparation.

516
32:20.385 --> 32:22.745
Says who? I do not!

517
32:23.505 --> 32:27.665
But someone has already read her speech three times since leaving home

518
32:27.745 --> 32:29.985
and checked her USB drive twice.

519
32:31.545 --> 32:32.505
Chen Yanzhou.

520
32:35.825 --> 32:36.905
That last part?

521
32:38.025 --> 32:38.865
Delete it.

522
32:50.745 --> 32:53.305
Now we have arrived at the entrance of the sharing session.

523
32:55.185 --> 32:56.545
Well, I'm heading in.

524
32:58.345 --> 32:59.865
I'll wait for you outside.

525
32:59.945 --> 33:01.025
Good luck!

526
33:21.545 --> 33:23.105
Why am I stuck outside?

527
33:23.185 --> 33:25.585
Because I'm not a student here.

528
33:30.385 --> 33:32.665
Honestly, isn't this rule a little unreasonable?

529
33:32.745 --> 33:34.465
They should make an exception for family.

530
33:37.065 --> 33:38.705
I just went to buy flowers.

531
33:43.185 --> 33:44.065
There's a poster of

532
33:44.145 --> 33:45.585
Ms. Zheng's sharing session.

533
33:46.345 --> 33:48.225
And here's her name.

534
33:49.425 --> 33:51.665
Our Ms. Zheng really is quite photogenic!

535
33:52.745 --> 33:55.985
Now, I'll give everyone a tour of Ms. Zheng's university.

536
33:56.905 --> 33:59.065
This is their exhibition hall.

537
33:59.145 --> 34:01.025
And that's their sports field.

538
34:01.105 --> 34:04.385
This is where I just saw Ms. Zheng's sharing session poster just now.

539
34:05.465 --> 34:07.025
And this is her classroom.

540
34:07.945 --> 34:09.264
She should be coming out soon.

541
34:09.344 --> 34:10.865
AUDITORIUM 2

542
34:14.545 --> 34:15.744
As expected.

543
35:46.745 --> 35:47.745
Let's go home.

544
35:50.425 --> 35:51.265
Wait.

545
35:52.545 --> 35:53.465
I need one last shot.

546
35:57.625 --> 35:59.625
I'm heading home with our Ms. Zheng.

547
36:01.505 --> 36:04.465
Why does this feel like I'm picking up a kindergartner after school?

548
36:06.465 --> 36:07.305
Let's go.

549
36:11.545 --> 36:14.505
With this sharing session wrapped up, the project is officially over.

550
36:15.225 --> 36:16.625
It's completely over.

551
36:16.705 --> 36:19.025
The professor also gave me some good news today.

552
36:20.305 --> 36:21.865
I'm getting a bonus.

553
36:22.545 --> 36:23.945
Is it from the lab?

554
36:24.025 --> 36:26.865
He said our results exceeded expectations

555
36:26.945 --> 36:28.425
and the partners were very pleased.

556
36:28.505 --> 36:29.585
So they gave us extra money.

557
36:30.345 --> 36:31.905
Then you should treat yourself.

558
36:32.705 --> 36:33.545
Of course.

559
36:34.225 --> 36:36.665
I'm going to use this money to…

560
36:36.745 --> 36:37.865
Have a feast?

561
36:39.745 --> 36:41.105
Buy plane tickets back home?

562
36:42.665 --> 36:45.585
Then buy a gift to reward yourself?

563
36:56.305 --> 36:57.505
To keep you.

564
37:02.905 --> 37:04.185
What's wrong?

565
37:05.065 --> 37:07.225
What… did you just say?

566
37:08.225 --> 37:11.705
I said I'm going to use the money to keep you.

567
37:12.945 --> 37:15.625
I think you have a lot going for you.

568
37:15.705 --> 37:16.945
You're quite a catch.

569
37:17.745 --> 37:20.585
You have the looks, you have the physique,

570
37:20.665 --> 37:21.945
and you're very sweet.

571
37:22.025 --> 37:23.145
Here's the deal.

572
37:23.705 --> 37:25.265
I'll take you on a trip.

573
37:25.345 --> 37:27.425
I'll cover all your expenses. What do you say?

574
37:32.945 --> 37:35.905
Does your boyfriend know about this?

575
37:41.425 --> 37:42.745
How about

576
37:42.825 --> 37:45.185
we keep it a secret and don't tell him?

577
37:45.265 --> 37:46.105
Problem solved.

578
37:47.865 --> 37:49.345
Then let's keep it a secret.

579
37:52.745 --> 37:55.785
So, does that mean you agree?

580
37:57.185 --> 37:59.105
Yes, of course I agree.

581
37:59.905 --> 38:01.105
So where are we going?

582
38:01.905 --> 38:03.025
You decide.

583
38:04.265 --> 38:06.145
I'll go wherever you go.

584
38:34.545 --> 38:37.225
After that day, we took a trip to Southern France.

585
38:38.465 --> 38:40.185
The sunshine there was so generous,

586
38:40.265 --> 38:42.985
making each day feel a little longer.

587
38:44.305 --> 38:46.745
So long that we suddenly realized

588
38:46.825 --> 38:49.265
we didn't need to keep ourselves busy

589
38:49.345 --> 38:51.185
just to fill the time.

590
39:11.065 --> 39:12.945
We returned to Berlin.

591
39:13.025 --> 39:14.825
Life didn't change all that much.

592
39:15.465 --> 39:17.345
Sometimes, we'd walk home together.

593
39:18.185 --> 39:20.465
Those 15 minutes were the only time all day

594
39:21.225 --> 39:23.305
when we didn't have a single thing to worry about.

595
39:24.625 --> 39:25.465
Most of the time,

596
39:25.545 --> 39:27.305
we were rushing around in different places,

597
39:27.385 --> 39:28.785
fighting our own battles.

598
39:29.745 --> 39:31.225
Of course,

599
39:31.305 --> 39:34.425
when classes and experiments became almost unbearable,

600
39:34.505 --> 39:37.145
we'd find ways to lift each other up,

601
39:37.225 --> 39:38.385
sometimes with a hug,

602
39:39.225 --> 39:40.785
or…

603
39:44.025 --> 39:45.625
When we felt anxious,

604
39:45.705 --> 39:47.865
we'd find ways to encourage each other.

605
39:49.065 --> 39:50.745
Well…

606
39:52.705 --> 39:53.865
You go first.

607
40:01.985 --> 40:03.825
It was just that the encouragement we sent out

608
40:04.545 --> 40:06.305
often found its way back into our own hands

609
40:06.385 --> 40:07.745
in mysterious ways.

610
40:09.345 --> 40:12.065
Sometimes, I'd suddenly feel happy for no reason at all.

611
40:12.145 --> 40:13.705
He could always handle it, anyway.

612
40:14.825 --> 40:17.145
Did you know Adam came to our school?

613
40:17.225 --> 40:20.865
We even shared tips on how to take really great photos!

614
40:21.465 --> 40:25.025
In autumn, we discovered a small park near our place.

615
40:25.745 --> 40:29.465
So on every sunny weekend, we'd go for a walk there.

616
40:30.345 --> 40:32.105
Once winter set in in Berlin,

617
40:32.185 --> 40:34.225
those walks became less frequent.

618
40:35.185 --> 40:37.745
He's sensitive to the cold, and I don't like the wind.

619
40:38.345 --> 40:41.185
So the two of us huddled together and found a compromise.

620
40:42.105 --> 40:44.305
Instead of going for walks, we'd snuggle somewhere cozy.

621
40:45.945 --> 40:48.465
Just like two little animals keeping each other warm.

622
40:48.545 --> 40:50.545
He always says I don't know how to take care of myself.

623
40:51.225 --> 40:54.825
But I'm actually pretty good at it. He's just quicker than I am.

624
40:54.905 --> 40:57.305
Dad, Mom. We're just out for a stroll.

625
40:57.385 --> 40:58.865
Hello!

626
40:58.945 --> 41:02.985
When spring arrived, we finally ventured beyond home and campus

627
41:03.065 --> 41:04.865
to explore nearby cities.

628
41:04.945 --> 41:08.945
Sometimes he'd video call home to share the scenery here.

629
41:09.025 --> 41:10.385
I almost forgot.

630
41:10.465 --> 41:12.745
We set up a group chat with his parents.

631
41:12.825 --> 41:14.185
Gao Xing and Xiaomian are in it too.

632
41:15.145 --> 41:17.025
Xiaomian pops in now and then,

633
41:17.105 --> 41:19.065
but as for Gao Xing,

634
41:19.865 --> 41:21.425
I suspect she's muted the chat.

635
41:22.385 --> 41:23.305
Oh, right.

636
41:23.385 --> 41:26.265
I heard his mom has decided to return to engineering.

637
41:27.105 --> 41:28.545
We're all so happy for her.

638
41:29.385 --> 41:31.745
It turns out we're not the only ones moving forward.

639
41:32.345 --> 41:35.465
Everyone else is also finding their own ways to make a fresh start.

640
41:37.065 --> 41:39.465
After graduation, we decided to return home.

641
41:40.625 --> 41:42.265
That summer before we left,

642
41:43.425 --> 41:44.465
he said

643
41:45.185 --> 41:47.225
there was something important he had to do.

644
41:52.465 --> 41:57.465
CHEN YANZHOU STARTED SHARING LOCATION

645
41:57.545 --> 41:59.185
2 PEOPLE ARE SHARING LOCATIONS

646
42:19.905 --> 42:22.025
BEACH

647
42:27.785 --> 42:29.945
CHEN YANZHOU WANTS TO SHARE A VIDEO

648
42:33.425 --> 42:36.585
Eleonore said that every time she pressed the shutter,

649
42:36.665 --> 42:38.665
it felt like pulling the trigger.

650
42:38.745 --> 42:42.465
As if she was stealing back beautiful moments from God before they slipped away.

651
42:43.425 --> 42:45.345
That's why we started taking photos.

652
42:45.425 --> 42:48.905
Later on, photos alone weren't enough for me,

653
42:48.985 --> 42:50.945
so I started recording videos too,

654
42:51.025 --> 42:54.185
hoping to capture every precious moment.

655
42:54.265 --> 42:55.225
Taking photos again?

656
42:58.425 --> 42:59.865
I'm recording a video.

657
43:00.385 --> 43:01.825
Recording a video?

658
43:01.905 --> 43:03.705
You seem to really enjoy taking videos lately.

659
43:04.385 --> 43:06.265
What are you going to use it for?

660
43:07.545 --> 43:11.945
If I ever edit a movie and it's released, you'd better come see it.

661
43:15.105 --> 43:18.465
Looking back at these recordings reminds me of when we first met.

662
43:19.505 --> 43:22.105
You were so different back then compared to now.

663
43:23.385 --> 43:24.785
Or maybe

664
43:24.865 --> 43:27.065
you change with every passing day.

665
43:27.745 --> 43:29.745
Just like these past few days,

666
43:29.825 --> 43:31.825
when we've been exploring so many places together.

667
43:50.625 --> 43:51.985
We're in Prague.

668
43:52.065 --> 43:54.105
It's so beautiful! Look!

669
43:57.905 --> 44:01.265
Sometimes, when you're happy, you act cute out of nowhere.

670
44:02.265 --> 44:05.585
Other times, when you're exhausted, you don't say a word.

671
44:06.625 --> 44:09.625
Sometimes, when the wind is too strong and messes up your hair,

672
44:09.705 --> 44:11.905
I get to see you letting out that little sigh.

673
44:12.905 --> 44:16.745
I've realized that I love every side of you.

674
44:18.265 --> 44:19.105
Zheng Yu.

675
44:20.745 --> 44:21.585
Zheng Yu.

676
44:22.265 --> 44:23.425
Zheng Yu!

677
44:24.225 --> 44:25.465
Zheng Yu!

678
44:26.585 --> 44:27.785
Zheng Yu.

679
44:30.865 --> 44:31.705
Zheng Yu.

680
44:45.785 --> 44:46.705
I think

681
44:47.465 --> 44:49.785
if we are going to be together for a long time,

682
44:49.865 --> 44:51.225
for ten years,

683
44:51.305 --> 44:52.785
twenty years,

684
44:52.865 --> 44:53.985
or fifty years,

685
44:55.545 --> 44:57.105
so many more changes

686
44:57.185 --> 44:59.025
will happen to us along the way.

687
45:00.305 --> 45:01.945
I want to know how the person you are today

688
45:02.025 --> 45:04.025
is different from the person you were yesterday.

689
45:04.745 --> 45:06.865
I want to know what will make you cry

690
45:06.945 --> 45:08.425
when you're 30,

691
45:09.385 --> 45:12.425
and what will make you laugh when you're 40.

692
45:14.265 --> 45:18.105
I want to know if, when you grow old, you'll still be just like you are now,

693
45:18.705 --> 45:22.345
challenging me to see who's better,

694
45:22.425 --> 45:26.625
or coming up with more silly things for us to do.

695
45:28.745 --> 45:29.985
Perhaps

696
45:31.185 --> 45:33.825
you'll show many more sides of yourself over the years.

697
45:33.905 --> 45:35.065
But I think

698
45:35.865 --> 45:38.025
I will stay forever curious about you.

699
45:40.065 --> 45:42.585
I'll never make you feel like I know everything about you.

700
45:44.985 --> 45:48.225
I want to be the first to notice every change in you,

701
45:48.825 --> 45:50.385
then smile and ask,

702
45:51.425 --> 45:53.265
"What happened today?"

703
45:59.705 --> 46:01.065
So…

704
46:13.385 --> 46:14.385
Zheng Yu.

705
46:15.065 --> 46:16.665
Will you marry me?

706
46:17.545 --> 46:21.105
Will you let me become your one and only legal husband?

707
46:26.945 --> 46:28.105
I…

708
46:28.185 --> 46:29.265
I will!

709
47:43.785 --> 47:45.505
Are we taking all of this back home?

710
47:45.585 --> 47:47.265
Or should we leave it with Marco for now

711
47:47.345 --> 47:48.785
and have him ship it to us later?

712
47:51.385 --> 47:52.585
What are you doing?

713
47:53.425 --> 47:55.465
Gao Xing wants to make a video for our wedding.

714
47:56.065 --> 47:58.865
She said it would be her way of congratulating us,

715
47:58.945 --> 48:01.745
and that it also counts as her class assignment too.

716
48:01.825 --> 48:03.025
She asked me to

717
48:03.105 --> 48:04.025
record more footage.

718
48:04.105 --> 48:05.945
We don't actually have to hold this camera up

719
48:06.025 --> 48:07.865
all the way from Berlin to Qingyi, do we?

720
48:08.705 --> 48:10.985
That's exactly what she told me to do.

721
48:13.025 --> 48:14.625
Aren't we spoiling her a bit too much?

722
48:16.825 --> 48:18.585
It's a 12-hour flight back home.

723
48:18.665 --> 48:20.345
I want some private time for just the two of us.

724
48:21.665 --> 48:23.185
Okay, no more filming then!

725
48:27.145 --> 48:28.185
We're on strike!

726
48:28.265 --> 48:29.225
On strike!

727
48:33.865 --> 48:34.945
Well…

728
48:35.025 --> 48:37.345
A teacher for a day is a father for a lifetime.

729
48:37.425 --> 48:38.545
In this case, cousin-in-law!

730
48:39.185 --> 48:40.465
Be serious.

731
48:40.545 --> 48:41.825
This is for our wedding video.

732
48:42.545 --> 48:43.425
Let's do it again.

733
48:46.305 --> 48:49.105
Our new journey is about to begin.

734
48:50.705 --> 48:51.585
Let's go!

735
49:01.985 --> 49:03.065
Bye!

736
49:05.825 --> 49:06.785
Hey.

737
49:08.665 --> 49:11.625
THIS DRAMA IS FOR EVERYONE WHO HAS EVER FELT THAT LIFE WAS UNBEARABLE AT NIGHT.

738
49:11.705 --> 49:14.425
PERHAPS YOU'RE WEATHERING THE RAIN, OR WALKING ALONE THROUGH DARKNESS.

739
49:14.505 --> 49:17.025
BUT ONE DAY, YOU'LL REALIZE YOU'RE STRONGER THAN YOU EVER IMAGINED.

740
49:17.105 --> 49:19.265
MAY WE ALL FIND THE STRENGTH TO WEATHER LIFE'S HARDSHIPS.

741
49:19.345 --> 49:21.545
THEN, TOGETHER, WALK TOWARDS A TOMORROW WITHOUT STORMS.

742
49:24.465 --> 49:26.465
Chen Yanzhou, a quick interview.

743
49:26.545 --> 49:29.065
Where would you ideally want to take our wedding photos?

744
49:30.465 --> 49:31.785
The location doesn't matter.

745
49:31.865 --> 49:33.825
It could be on a street, by the sea,

746
49:33.905 --> 49:35.185
or even at home.

747
49:36.225 --> 49:39.305
I think as long as we're together, the photos will be beautiful.

748
49:39.905 --> 49:41.025
I feel the same way.

749
50:10.905 --> 50:11.905
You look beautiful.

750
50:12.825 --> 50:13.905
You look handsome too.

751
51:02.665 --> 51:05.185
It's a sunset.

752
51:05.265 --> 51:06.505
A sunset.

753
51:26.985 --> 51:30.585
THEIR STORY HAS COME TO AN END, BUT YOUR LIFE GOES ON.

754
51:30.665 --> 51:34.385
IF YOU EVER ENCOUNTER A SUN-SHOWER AGAIN, WE HOPE IT REMINDS YOU OF THIS DRAMA.

755
51:34.465 --> 51:38.745
REMEMBER ZHENG YU AND CHEN YANZHOU, AND ALL THOSE LITTLE, VIVID MOMENTS.

756
51:38.825 --> 51:43.945
THANK YOU FOR COMING TO WITNESS THEIR STORY, AND THANK YOU FOR LOVING THEM.

757
54:08.945 --> 54:13.945
Subtitle translation by: Cempaka Malinja
